~ start 
do play_local_video("res://Tutorial/Tutorial_combined_pt1.ogv")
1/6: Type the phrases as they appear on the terminal. A [color=#639765]Green[/color] letter is a letter that needs to by typed.
- next ->
	do NextClickSound()
	

~ second
do play_local_video("res://Tutorial/Tutorial_combined_pt2.ogv")
2/6: [color=#4682b4]Blue[/color] letters are previously correctly typed characters, while [color=#a65455]Red[/color] signifies incorrect letters that need to be deleted.
- back <-
	do BackClickSound()
	=> start
- next ->
	do NextClickSound()


~ third
do play_local_video("res://Tutorial/Tutorial_combined_pt3.ogv")
3/6: Pressing [b][u]backspace[/u][/b] to delete a character will deduct a finger from your hands, however if you hold [b][u]backspace[/u][/b] to delete multiple characters, it will count as only deleting 1 finger.
- back <-
	do BackClickSound()
	=> second
- next ->
	do NextClickSound()


~ fourth
if SaveManager.time_mode:
	do play_local_video("res://Tutorial/Tutorial_combined_alt_pt4.ogv")
	4/6: Every 10 seconds the terminal will malfunction. This will cause your keystoke to not register, represented as a [color=9901efff]Purple[/color] character. Every finger you lose will cause the timer to go faster
else:
	do play_local_video("res://Tutorial/Tutorial_combined_pt4.ogv")
	4/6: For every lost finger you add a 2.5% chance for the terminal to malfunction. This will cause your keystoke to not register, represented as a [color=9901efff]Purple[/color] character. [center] [/center]
- back <-
	do BackClickSound()
	=> third
- next ->
	do NextClickSound()


~ fifth
do play_local_video("res://Tutorial/Tutorial_combined_pt5.ogv")
5/6: You must finish tracing all passwords before the security timer autolocks the terminal. You will need at least [b][u]1[/u][/b] finger remaining.
- back <-
	do BackClickSound()
	=> fourth
- next ->
	do NextClickSound()


~ sixth
do play_local_video("res://Tutorial/Tutorial_combined_pt6.ogv")
6/6: Your score on the leaderboard will depend firstly on the number of [b][u]fingers[/u][/b] you have remaining, then [b][u]time[/u][/b] will be taken into account. [center][pulse freq=1.0 color=#ffffff40 ease=-2.0]Press F to accept mission[/pulse][/center]
- back <-
	do BackClickSound()
	=> fifth
=> END